#. module: om_ai_extract
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_om_ai_extract
msgid ""
"\n"
"Document reading for Odoo on the AI engine, with your own provider or a local model. PDFs are read from their text,\n"
"scans and photos by a vision model. Every answer follows a JSON schema that is checked in code, comes with a\n"
"confidence and flags, and is shown for review: nothing is posted automatically. This module reads bank statements\n"
"into statement lines; its bridges read vendor bills (with Vendor Bill OCR), expense receipts and CVs.\n"
msgstr ""

